/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (EP Biocomposites Limited \(EPBL\), part of the EP Kamat Group, is a Goa based, BSE SME listed manufacturer and one of India's sole Transfer of Technology \(ToT\) holders for DRDO certified bio digester sanitation technology. Founded in 1991, the group has built over three decades of manufacturing credibility. Its bio digester toilets are an alternative to conventional septic tanks, using inoculum bacteria to break down human waste anaerobically. The process deactivates 99% of pathogens with no sludge accumulation and no bad odour, and the only by-products are water suitable for gardening or other non-potable reuse, plus odourless gas.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (EPBL also offers Sewage and Effluent Treatment Plants \(STP/ETP\), along with FRP based advanced modular STP technologies and ozone based oxy-STP. It provides standard modular units for apartments, housing colonies, hotels and customised ETPs for hospitals and industries. EPBL has executed institutional projects including the Hubli Smart City Unkal Nullah wetland project and sanitation-related projects with organisations such as ONGC and Government of Goa.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
